<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank calls for bids on 3 pct repos.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank calls for bids on 3 pct repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank called for bids on two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed and unchanged rate of three percent on Thursday.</p>
<p>Bids have to be in by 0800 GMT on Friday.</p>
<p>Last week the central bank allotted 16.13 billion schillings in repos, filling 13 percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
